   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_ZURI_08">Universitätstrasse 38 I</name>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_CHE_ZURI">Zurich</name>
                            </addrLine>
                        </address>
                    </ab> </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Dear <name type="person" key="weav76">Miss Weaver</name>: Thanks for your letter. I have written now to <name type="person" key="cour50">Mr Courtney</name>. Will you please send on <seg xml:id="seg1" type="note-anchor">a copy</seg> to him c/o <name type="work">
                            <hi rend="underline">Daily Telegraph</hi>
                        </name>? Has the first instalment of <name type="work" key="W_ULYSSES">
                            <hi rend="underline">Ulysses</hi>
                        </name> appeared in <name type="work" key="W_THEEGOIST">
                            <hi rend="underline">The Egoist</hi>
                        </name>? I have sent on the fifth episode now to <name type="person" key="poun85">Mr Pound</name>.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>                         	In haste and with kind regards</salute>
                        <salute>                                	sincerely yours</salute>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">                                            	James Joyce</name>
                        </signed> <dateline>
                            <date when="1918-04-14">14/iv/918</date>
                        </dateline>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="note1" target="#seg1" type="commentary">A copy of <name type="work" key="W_APORTRAIT">A Portrait of the Artist as a Young Man</name>.</note>
            </div>
